v2/backend/app/cli/paper_online_runtime.py:Mission Control, Paper Trading, Trainer Prediction Monitor, Signal Explainability, and Risk Control now have a current V2 paper runtime source. Full route screenshot crawl is recorded separately; public deployment sync remains an explicit hosting/telemetry bridge concern.
